  "title": "Ancestor of the Arabs",
  "era": "patriarchs",
  "lifespan": "c. 1910–1773 BC",
  "summary": "Ishmael was Abraham's firstborn son with the slave woman Hagar. Although he was not the child of the promise, God blessed him and promised that he would become the ancestor of twelve princes and a great nation. He is regarded as the forefather of the Arab peoples.",
