          "chapter": 17,
          "verses": [
            23,
            25,
            26
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Promise of Twelve Princes",
      "description": "God promised Abraham that Ishmael would be fruitful and become the father of twelve princes and a great nation.",
      "verses": [
        {
          "bookId": 1,
          "chapter": 17,
          "verses": [
            20
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sent away into the wilderness",
      "description": "Ishmael and Hagar were sent away after Sarah saw him laughing with Isaac. God saved them in the wilderness.",
